The stratum dialect and the share rule follow how rieMiner and StellaPool behave (both GPL-3, by the Riecoin
team: https://github.com/RiecoinTeam). Their code was read for behaviour only; no code was copied from them.
tests/data holds real Riecoin mainnet blocks and shares produced by rieMiner, used as test vectors.

Rust dependencies: sha2, serde_json, num-bigint, num-traits, num-integer (all MIT or Apache-2.0).
